<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-28T13:18:38.484Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:18:38 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen have continued high-profile attacks in northern Nigeria, killing civilians in Plateau and abducting residents from Kaduna's Millennium City estate. Bandits stormed a Kaduna estate again, taking six people, while soldiers repelled an assault in Benue and recovered rifles. A large-scale assault in the northeast resulted in at least 62 deaths. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNaTZHekRTSzFOQThfNS00SWJLT1hjNlRPdHIzTl9KbWh1b1lkR1dYcTBhZXdfSloyZERTX2ZMV1ZmZXpXZW5qZE95bXRqOGIwSDBPTzdldXBqYS14eWhwWFhUdzUwLWNiRDNvenZXb0F2UWJVMXNnMVJYb2JXeFc2dzl6VEQ4a3VRcTBnUURB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE83bEJFN3QwcG93Mkh5dDJ4SVdKWFRHZkxTZmtlZ0dHb0N3V1BFTzFBdTB3aGYyRHNVUHVRSm1OZjNwc0swVWFhNFJ0N0JOV3FJLUZzdWVySk9WWEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTnRKbF9zaV91aVhVa2paT1A3TTRBZFBsaThqenNjcVJYZFpJcVNGUVdybkVDZk81U2dEVENHekVZMUZjODBld3MtZnJfenhvWE9zSFlLMmM2UUdmVTdKMzhZTHRrTDU5NXFNdXowSXFiNUFkSklodjN5a2d6Rk0tTGl6UEtkcUMzOV9NalhRVFNJcC1RMjducjl1VmJNZHBjdlZNNThXTW9SMkJvbWljNkh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Businessday NG&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQbjlER0U3cjhqNFpYTkhCZFZoQ2hFNVBpaFBRTTh2WjVOdWU5MThiYUhGY0xCLUlVdGpBMDdTNkFpc0VMaVFHRS1EcTV0R0JpOGh5LWJ4azktb2FoMW9IVUdVVkkzZG1pQk8yb29oR2NBUEdKeVBBNGRaODIyQ2x4MGdxSlplMEw1VGgwaWY2WFlXTTdKZ0x3OW5nVVZiaGhCUlQwQlhJRmo0cTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNMU05d0QxdUlQYmZOZWJxOGhKRXpQclhLWlREYm8zdVhJMnpQVFZOUmlpMzBVQW85a